  "sourceTitle": "Mint Tea",
  "sourceText": "Mint Tea\nBy: Amritha Kalyani\nPublished: Wednesday, September 15, 2010 - 4:00pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 tablespoon Green Tea Leaves-\n15 leafs Mint Leaves-\n1 tablespoon Honey\n2 cups Water\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Boil 2 cups water immerse green tea leaves and mint leaves in that hot water. Leave it for 2 mins and drain the leaves. 2 Mix honey in the tea and serve hot. 3 Very refreshing winter drink.",
  "parsedSource": {
