        "sourceText": "1 tablespoon Honey"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "2 cups Water"
      }
    ],
    "steps": [
      {
        "text": "1 Boil 2 cups water immerse green tea leaves and mint leaves in that hot water. Leave it for 2 mins and drain the leaves. 2 Mix honey in the tea and serve hot. 3 Very refreshing winter drink."
